<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update- Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update- Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>KARACHI, Mar 16 - Seven vessels waiting off port, comprising one container waiting two days, three fertilisers, the first waiting 19 days, one loader waiting three days and two oil tankers, the first waiting seven days. Five vessels waiting off port for own reasons.</p>
</text>
